	(text "Native USB: GPIO18 / GPIO19 -> 22R -> USB_INTERFACE sheet.\nUSB current policy, protection and no-cell radio loading remain unqualified."
		(at 25.4 182.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "87d81598-b4a6-4991-ae47-9bdddd3e5534")
	)
	(text "EXTERNAL CONVERTER / USB OR OPTIONAL PROTECTED 1S LOGIC POWER\nRT9080 3.3V LDO; never apply 5V to the module supply or GPIO.\nCell dropout, USB current budget and total logic thermal limits remain unqualified.\nCommon ground: no USB isolation or HV fault containment.\nNo generator-derived logic supply."
		(at 25.4 163.83 0)
		(effects
